WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.505
NARRATOR: The
migrating humpbacks

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:10.877
have only one objective now,
the safe house of Mozambique.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:18.351
It's a whale-birthing paradise
far from the usual hunting

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.153
grounds of great white sharks.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.826
Vulnerable baby whales can
nurse, grow, and gain strength.

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:37.670
The adults have traveled
4,000 miles to safety.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.306
The warm water and
lack of predators

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:44.277
give their species the
best chance of survival.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:47.781
[whale singing]

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:54.087
It's a magical time.

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.956
The whales spend up
to four months mating,

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.092
birthing, and
nursing their young.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:03.563
[soothing music]

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:27.220
This is their time
to bond and interact.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.463
But these adult whales
have not eaten since they

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.631
left Antarctica months ago.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:46.372
Their strength
diminishes each day,

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.743
and the time is coming when
all of the adults and calves

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:54.013
will have to swim the 4,000
miles back to Antarctica

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:54.814
to feed.

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.054
Now, after four
months up in Mozambique,

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.922
they start this
return migration down,

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.891
and that's when it's going
to get really interesting.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.392
Because at that
stage, you're going

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.328
to have these weak whales,
these whales that haven't fed

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.730
up enough that have been starved
for the last four or five

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:11.865
months.

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.533
And as they go
down, they're going

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.301
to be the ones that,
I think, are really

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.871
vulnerable to attack by sharks.

